{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-ludai-ten-thoughts","title":"《志林》吕岱戒恪十思、恪答再思可矣","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-b75c03ba2fe4614946b3","label":"裴注·志林（引虞喜论）","text":"权病笃召恪辅政，临去大司马吕岱戒之世方多难子每事必十思；恪答季文子三思夫子曰再思可矣，今君令恪十思明恪之劣也；岱无以答，当时咸谓之失言（后附虞喜论）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0086","role":"戒恪每事十思","evidence":["santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"答以再思可矣","evidence":["santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8","source_order":[64,290,0],"order":10973}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0086","name":"吕岱","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-7e465f3f774f341ad4c8","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-eb0289b496f355e7d0e4","layer":"pei","quote":"《志林》曰：“初，权病笃，召恪辅政。临去，大司马吕岱戒之曰：‘世方多难，子每事必十思！’恪答曰：‘昔季文子三思而后行，夫子曰“再思可矣”；今君令恪十思，明恪之劣也！’岱无以答，当时咸谓之失言。","attribution":"裴注·志林（引虞喜论）","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":289,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-05ba95bd39738a5fe599","start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
